## Business Problem

Business dashboards depend on reliable upstream data.

If a pipeline fails, loads late, produces zero records, or brings mismatched data, downstream dashboards can show inaccurate information.

Common business risks include:

```text
Dashboard refresh completes with incomplete data
Sales reporting does not match expected source totals
Inventory output shows stale or missing records
Purchase order data does not reconcile
Business users make decisions using delayed or incorrect data
Data engineering teams are not alerted early enough
```

This project demonstrates how pipeline monitoring and validation can reduce those risks.

