## Technical Objective

The objective of this framework is to monitor whether pipeline outputs are reliable before data is consumed by reporting teams.

The framework focuses on:

- Reading pipeline execution logs
- Reviewing row count validation results
- Checking schema validation outputs
- Detecting failed or delayed pipeline runs
- Detecting zero-record loads
- Flagging source-to-target mismatches
- Identifying schema drift
- Classifying issue severity
- Creating exception summaries for review

